  "text": "Recipe: Ezekiel Sandwich with Walnut Mushroom Pate\nCreator: Kumar Natarajan\nCategory: Sandwich\nIngredients: walnuts, chopped mushrooms, red onion, garlic cloves, parsley (or cilantro), green chili, salt, black pepper, Ezekiel 4:9 bread, mung bean sprouts, spinach\nCooking methods: roast, saute, blend, toast, no-cook\nInstructions: WALNUT MUSHROOM PATE:\nDry roast the walnuts. Set aside to cool.\nSauté mushrooms, onion & garlic for a few minutes (without oil). Let them cool down.\nBlend the dry roasted walnuts and sautéed onion, garlic & mushroom, along with parsley, green chili and black pepper.\n\nSANDWICH:\nSpread Walnut Mushroom Pate on toasted Ezekiel 4:9 bread. Top with mung bean sprouts and spinach.\nNotes: Walnut Mushroom Pate (sub-recipe)",
